  - key: htp_title
    value: HOW TO PLAY
  - key: htp_content
    value: "1. Use WASD (P1) or Arrow Keys (P2) to select a unit in the shop. The
      selected unit will spawn automatically at the start of each wave,\r\n  when
      the timer reaches zero.\r\n\r\n  2. Hover over any unit to see its stats: HP,
      damage, speed, cost and income bonus.\r\n\r\n  3. Each deployed unit generates
      income \u2014 the more units on the field, the faster your gold grows.\r\n\r\n 
      4. Destroy the enemy base to win!\r\n\r\n  5. Use the minimap to track the
      battle.\r\n\r\n  6. Top panel shows your stats:\r\n     Gold \u2014 current
      amount to spend\r\n     Income \u2014 gold earned each wave\r\n     Supply
      \u2014 units on the field out of the maximum allowed. Each unit has a different
      supply cost."
  - key: htp_button
    value: HOW TO PLAY
